WEBVTT

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.170
Damn that magical girl...

00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.240
I'm going to defeat her and get back 
my mana crystal, no matter what.

00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:19.790
<b>Craft Pub <b>Maou.</b></b>

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:19.790
I swear it as the Dark Realm's 
second-in-command!

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:38.540
Boss?

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:55.340
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.130
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:56.920
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:57.630
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:58.420
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:00.370
<b>The Great Jahy Will <i>NOT</i> Be Defeated<i>!</i></b>

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:15.530
<b>Restoration Plan No. 7

00:02:11.240 --> 00:02:12.940
So, what are you doing?

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:17.610
I haven't gotten any exercise lately,
 so I was doing some drills.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:19.160
Huh.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:25.230
I'm always motivated in the beginning, 
but I can't seem to keep it up.

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.580
Huh.

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:30.540
I know, Hy-chan! 
Would you be my workout buddy?

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:32.920
I asked Ryou-chan, but...

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.710
No way.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:36.800
That's what she said.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.000
So please, Hy-chan!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.260
Why should I do that?

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:44.240
I'll give you more food after your shifts.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:46.390
I'll even take requests.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:49.260
I guess I can't leave you hangin'!

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.810
Yay!

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:10.870
Push-ups... really are hard!

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:22.000
If they're too much for you, 
you can just take it slow.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:26.260
They're not hard at all!

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:45.100
Hy-chan! Let's just take it slow.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:47.350
It's hard for everyone 
when they first start out.

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:51.290
There's nothing I cannot do...

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:52.610
I won't stand for that!

00:03:52.610 --> 00:03:54.040
Hyah!

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:57.250
Let's make your next set one rep.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:59.140
Hyah!

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.680
<i>There's nothing I cannot do!</i>

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.250
<i>Let's dance!</i>

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:11.470
<i>First, we'll get our arms in the air 
and step from side to side.</i>

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:13.890
<i>Make sure to keep your arms up.</i>

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.780
<i>One! Two! Three! Four!</i>

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.730
<i>Five! Six! Seven!</i>

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.900
Hy-chan!

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.500
I can't. I can't do this.

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.330
Of course you can.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:46.470
Just keep at it and you'll 
slowly get better, little by little.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:50.680
You just started, 
so you're doing fine, Hy-chan.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:54.640
I'm not disciplined enough 
to stick with things,

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:57.910
so I'm really glad you 
agreed to do this with me.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:01.820
Thank you, Hy-chan.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.380
Let's do this together.

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:05.380
Yeah!

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:12.150
<i>And so the two of them started 
training morning until night.</i>

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.580
<i>Through the rain. Through the wind.</i>

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.790
<i>They exercised without fail.</i>

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:24.320
Twenty-nine...

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:27.520
Thirty!

00:05:28.470 --> 00:05:30.740
We did it!

00:05:30.740 --> 00:05:32.940
We really did, Hy-chan.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:34.930
Both of us.

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:39.900
I kinda feel like I've gotten stronger...

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:43.140
I get it! This is what I was missing.

00:05:43.140 --> 00:05:44.860
I just needed to work out!

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:48.620
If I keep this up, 
I can defeat that magical girl.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.350
I'm ready to hit it again tomorrow!

00:05:57.880 --> 00:05:59.170
<i>The next day...</i>

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:02.380
Boss, let's try this next.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:05.340
It's a coupon trial pass 
for a gym or something.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:09.260
You can get a great workout there, apparently.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:15.040
That's nice... but I'm actually 
back to my original weight.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.560
My diet was a success!

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:21.560
See? Look! My upper arms were so flabby, 
but now they're quite sleek.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:24.260
And it's all thanks to you joining me.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:26.670
Thank you so much, Hy-chan!

00:06:28.170 --> 00:06:29.610
But our training...

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:32.880
Flab be gone!

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:33.950
Flab be...

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:37.910
<b>Free Trial Pass</b>

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.130
What is wrong with her?

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:46.730
I regret getting swept up
in the stupid workout hype.

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:49.870
My magical powers and stamina 
are both completely drained.

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:53.290
Oh, well... Time to hit the hay.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:25.750
Pipe down!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:29.970
Damn, you are so loud!
Do you know what time it is?!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:32.700
Knock it off, jackass!

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.390
It's over.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:40.610
Jeez, to get between me and sleep...

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:43.220
Must have some balls.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.330
Pipe down!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.520
How... many... times...

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:07.210
do I have to say it?!

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:10.960
Do you have cats in your ears or something?!

00:08:10.960 --> 00:08:14.930
It's nighttime! Go to bed already!

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:21.140
Damn... I'm exhausted from 
being on my feet all day.

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:23.750
The landlord will be hearing 
about this tomorrow.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.250
I hope you realize...

00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:29.150
who you're dealing with...

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:42.040
So that's how it's going to be, huh?

00:08:42.360 --> 00:08:43.790
Challenge accepted!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:48.500
You'll rue the day you crossed
the Dark Realm's second-in-command!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.990
Well?! Annoying, huh?! Annoying, isn't it?!

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:53.720
Eat it!

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.530
I wanna go to sleep!

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:58.500
Go to sleep!

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:00.560
Go to sleep!

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.820
Go to sleep!

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:08.950
They're...

00:09:21.720 --> 00:09:24.440
It can't be... 
They're responding to my sounds?

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.790
Not so fast!

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:02.640
<i>The Great Jahy's jam session with her 
neighbor lasted until morning.</i>

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:10.630
Tenacious... li'l bastard...

00:10:10.940 --> 00:10:17.050
But now... it's finally quiet...

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.360
Damn it!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.890
I feel like I got no sleep, 
and it's totally the neighbor's fault!

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.400
I'm going over to complain to their face!

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:33.860
Hey! We need to talk!

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:36.980
What's wrong with you, 
keeping me up like that?!

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:39.600
I'm not going to let you 
get away with it again!

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.200
What are you doing?

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:45.400
Listen!

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.470
So, my neighbor kept making 
a racket all through the night.

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:50.480
Hey! The landlord's here now!

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:53.340
I know you're in there, so open up!

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:57.130
That unit's empty.

00:10:58.440 --> 00:10:59.220
Huh?

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:07.360
<i>Huh?</i>

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:13.610
<i>The Great Jahy was growing impatient...</i>

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:15.970
Damn!

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:17.550
Nothing...

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:19.480
Nothing!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.530
I can't believe it! Where's my mana crystal?!

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:26.460
Hey, what a cool rock!

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:27.400
What?

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:31.370
Really... That kid?

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:33.740
This is my chance!

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:37.380
A kid doesn't stand a chance against me.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:41.340
Oh, it cracked...

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:42.500
Hey, you there!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:44.850
That rock belongs to me! I dropped it.

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:46.970
You have my thanks for finding it.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:49.270
Now, surrender it forthwith.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:51.550
Never.

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:52.500
Huh?

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:53.570
Who are you anyway?

00:11:53.570 --> 00:11:55.150
What grade are you in?

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:58.360
You should be more respectful
with kids older than you.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:02.480
I'll give it to you if you say,
"May I please have that stone?"

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:04.060
Do what?

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:06.240
What'd you just say to me, you little brat?

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:08.240
Says the even smaller brat.

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:11.690
You talk funny, too.

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:13.220
Like some old fart.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:15.920
You snot-nosed squirt!

00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:21.470
Hmph. So the problem's my form, is it?

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:24.930
Shall I show you Jahy's true greatness?

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:42.770
Well, how about now?

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:45.700
No further questions, hmm?

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.750
Cat got your tongue?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.250
Now, relinquish that mana crystal!

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.440
Pervert lady!

00:12:53.440 --> 00:12:54.690
Say what?!

00:12:54.690 --> 00:12:56.000
Leave me alone!

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.560
Hey, wait!

00:12:57.560 --> 00:13:00.250
Pervert lady!

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.340
If you want it so bad, you can have it!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:09.590
How dare you treat my previous 
mana crystal like that?

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:13.810
This isn't a mana crystal.

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:18.810
I can't believe I played 
along with that brat!

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.320
How humiliating!

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:28.190
My mana crystal is faintly responding...

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:31.090
It should definitely be 
somewhere around here.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:42.800
Hey, what are you doing?

00:13:45.940 --> 00:13:48.510
The hell did you come from?!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.740
Did you drop something?

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:52.140
Shoo! Shoo!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.140
Scram, kid!

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:55.600
I don't have time for you.

00:13:55.850 --> 00:13:58.260
I'll help you look.

00:13:58.260 --> 00:13:59.750
You need help, right?

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:05.690
My mom told me that when 
someone's in need, we should help them.

00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:11.530
You think a little girl like you 
can find something like this?

00:14:11.530 --> 00:14:14.620
I don't know. I'll do my best.

00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:17.150
What are we looking for, anyway?

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:20.180
Well... that's...

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:22.500
<i>What's up with this kid?</i>

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.050
<i>She's throwing me off.</i>

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:28.330
<i>Maybe she wants the mana crystal for herself!</i>

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:33.930
It looks like this.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:39.820
Wow, that's so pretty! Just lovely!

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:41.420
Y-You think so?

00:14:41.420 --> 00:14:45.480
Yeah! I've never seen such 
a lovely stone before.

00:14:45.480 --> 00:14:48.610
Ah, so you can appreciate
 how incredible this is.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:51.320
<i>Worlds apart from that little brat earlier.</i>

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:57.290
My mom won't buy me stuff like this.
 She says I'm too young.

00:14:57.650 --> 00:14:59.500
You're so fancy.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:04.750
W-Well, mana crystals aren't meant
for puny humans like you.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.030
They're really special.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.590
Mana crystals? What're those?

00:15:09.810 --> 00:15:11.990
I'll make a special exception and tell you.

00:15:11.990 --> 00:15:14.850
They contain tremendous power.
They're the source of our magic.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:20.060
But if humans hold them,
terrible misfortune will befall them.

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:23.000
Really? That sounds dangerous.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.020
That's right.

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:27.030
What you see now is not my true form.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:30.990
I need more mana crystals to sustain it.

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:35.110
And once I've reattained 
my original magic powers,

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:37.840
I will the defeat the bane
 of my existence, that magical girl,

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.670
and restore the Dark Realm.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:43.330
Though I'm pretty sure
 that's all over your head.

00:15:44.550 --> 00:15:46.130
How cool!

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:49.880
So if we find that rock, 
you're going to get super strong?

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:51.340
Amazing!

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:56.610
That reminds me. I don't know your name yet.

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:59.860
Mine's Kokoro. What about you?

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:00.980
Kokoro, huh?

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:03.370
Well, my name is Jahy!

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:05.110
You can call me the Great Jahy.

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:08.320
Got it, Great Jahy!

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:16.000
<i>Humans are usually such a pain in the ass,</i>

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:19.490
<i>but I feel like this girl really gets it.</i>

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.710
Hey, now's not the time for slacking!

00:16:24.030 --> 00:16:26.870
If we don't find the crystal soon,
 the sun's going to set.

00:16:26.870 --> 00:16:28.320
R-Right!

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:32.640
I'll look over here.
You check over there.

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:33.770
Okay!

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:37.760
<i>She offered to help look 
for the mana crystal herself,</i>

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.810
<i>so I'll take full advantage of her!</i>

00:16:57.010 --> 00:17:00.660
Damn it. I thought it would 
be around here somewhere.

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:03.600
We just can't find it, Great Jahy....

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:05.330
You don't have to tell me that.

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.110
<i>Already ready to give up, huh?</i>

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:11.130
<i>Flighty kids are so unreliable...</i>

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:13.540
Maybe we should try looking somewhere else.

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:14.590
Huh?

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:17.910
I mean, it's really important to you, right?

00:17:17.910 --> 00:17:20.420
Are there any other places you can think of?

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:24.510
<i>Ack! What is this light?</i>

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:27.910
<i>O-Oh, right. It's just the sun behind her.</i>

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:30.250
<i>It's not because I was overwhelmed!</i>

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:32.970
All right.

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:35.700
I suppose we can take your 
idea into consideration.

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:40.660
Great Jahy, why don't we go 
ask at the police station?

00:17:40.970 --> 00:17:42.320
The police station?!

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:46.210
If you lost something,
 I think the police would help.

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:53.690
No way!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:56.390
Nothing good could come
 of him butting into this.

00:17:56.390 --> 00:18:01.470
Oh, I see. I get it. 
Police officers are big and scary.

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:04.150
It's better if we just look for it ourselves.

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:08.190
I'm sorry I forgot how 
important it is to you.

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:09.890
Yeah...

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:12.080
<i>What is this heavy feeling?</i>

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:14.330
<i>Whenever she smiles, my chest hurts.</i>

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:17.620
Everybody's so useless!

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:20.010
Just forget it! 
I'm going to go find it myself!

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:22.340
You should go home, Kokoro!

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:23.990
Great Jahy?

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:34.550
<i>I can't stand feeling this way anymo—</i>

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:41.840
Great Jahy!

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:45.980
Hold on!

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:51.350
All better now, right?

00:18:53.560 --> 00:18:54.670
Why...?

00:18:56.300 --> 00:19:00.610
I'm really clumsy, so I'm 
always getting hurt all over.

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:03.860
So my mom told me to keep bandages on me.

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:08.380
Kokoro, you're...

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:15.090
Over here!

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:17.160
Oh crap, it's time!

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:19.220
Let's race home!

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:22.830
Isn't it time for you to go, too?

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:23.720
Yeah.

00:19:29.140 --> 00:19:30.460
What is it?

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:32.520
I think we'll find one here!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.610
Find... Oh, the mana crystal?

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:41.120
Got it!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:42.320
Really?!

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:44.140
Great job, Kokoro!

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:44.900
Now, hand it—

00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:45.830
Look!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.410
A four-leaf clover!

00:19:47.840 --> 00:19:48.600
<i>A what?</i>

00:19:50.420 --> 00:19:51.260
See?

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:56.920
I was looking for mana crystals, 
not some freakin' weed!

00:19:57.440 --> 00:19:59.060
Here. It's for you.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:01.120
I'm telling you I don't want it!

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:05.890
What? But a four-leaf clover 
brings you good luck.

00:20:08.290 --> 00:20:11.810
I hope you find happiness!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:14.310
I'm sure you'll find that 
mana crystal soon, too.

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:19.280
Happiness?

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:29.900
I'm sorry we couldn't find it today.

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:32.810
Let's look for it again, Great Jahy!

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:35.420
S-Sure.

00:20:51.660 --> 00:20:55.940
Maybe I was being too impatient.

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.650
Thank you for waiting!

00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:01.650
Ah, here we go!

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:05.240
My, Hy-chan. You're in
 an awfully good mood today.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.120
Same as always.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:09.530
Excuse me, check please!

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.740
Coming right up!

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:16.300
<i>Touched by Kokoro's pure heart, 
the Great Jahy's own heart softened a bit.</i>

00:22:46.890 --> 00:22:50.220
Hy-chan, thank you helping me with my diet.

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:53.220
I brought some sweets as a thank-you.

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:55.080
You've been wanting some, right?

00:22:55.080 --> 00:22:57.730
Sweets? Like, for free?!

00:22:57.730 --> 00:23:02.190
In that case, I'm totally fine 
with you yanking my chain.

00:23:02.450 --> 00:23:05.160
You really did a great job.

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:07.150
You deserve a reward.

00:23:13.080 --> 00:23:14.530
<i>And the next day...</i>

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:17.950
<i>And the next day...</i>

00:23:19.820 --> 00:23:21.370
<i>And the next day...</i>

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:32.580
I'm even heavier than before?!

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.980
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.980
<b>The Great Jahy Won't Bathe!</b>
